00 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533893 true] [17592186264100 1100 "The position $s(t)$ of a particle (in miles) at time $t$ hours is given by \n\n$$\ns(t)=\\frac{3}{t},\\,t>0.\n$$\n\nCalculate the speed of the particle when $t=3\\,\\text{h}.$" 13194139533893 true] [17592186264100 1113 #uuid "d585be43-c802-5898-9f5b-2c2fe6d06f55" 13194139533893 true] [17592186264100 1145 "First, we calculate the velocity function by differentiating the position function:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{3}{t}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{{t}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhen $t=3,$ the velocity is\n\n$$\nv(3)=-\\frac{3}{{3}^{2}}=-\\frac{1}{3}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the speed is $|-\\frac{1}{3}|=\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{miles/h}.$" 13194139533893 true] [17592186264101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264102 13194139533893 true] [17592186264101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264103 13194139533893 true] [17592186264101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264104 13194139533893 true] [17592186264101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264105 13194139533893 true] [17592186264101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264106 13194139533893 true] [17592186264101 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533893 true] [17592186264101 1041 "selection" 13194139533893 true] [17592186264101 1104 #edb/ref 17592186264103 13194139533893 true] [17592186264101 1110 #uuid "74f92c50-9db9-5edf-b81f-7ca1784d0f70" 13194139533893 true] [17592186264102 1034 "3\\,\\text{miles/h}" 13194139533893 true] [17592186264102 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533893 true] [17592186264102 1111 #uuid "bdd6723b-2976-54e8-ae1d-8ff9bbaca195" 13194139533893 true] [17592186264103 1034 "\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{miles/h}" 13194139533893 true] [17592186264103 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533893 true] [17592186264103 1111 #uuid "17390346-4487-530a-bc57-de1feaddd428" 13194139533893 true] [17592186264104 1034 "\\frac{2}{3}\\,\\text{miles/h}" 13194139533893 true] [17592186264104 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533893 true] [1